## Examples and Data

- Examples directory: [examples/](mdc:examples)
  - Core usage: [examples/example_core_modules.py](mdc:examples/example_core_modules.py)
  - High-level wrapper usage: [examples/example_highlevel_function.py](mdc:examples/example_highlevel_function.py)
  - Notebooks: [examples/RunExample.ipynb](mdc:examples/RunExample.ipynb)
  - HTML demo: [examples/Demo-SampleOutput.html](mdc:examples/Demo-SampleOutput.html)

- Sample data: [examples/sample_data/](mdc:examples/sample_data)
  - Images: `*.jpeg`, `*.png`
  - COCO annotations: `coco-annotation.json`, `partial-coco-annotation.json`

## Tips

- Adjust paths in examples to your local file locations.
- Confirm that image names in data match those referenced by COCO annotations.
- Use the wrapper’s `accept_and_process_modif_di` to derive consistent settings from your input spec.

